  data:
    name: Set your Baked Lights to Static
    description: "<b>\u2022 What It Does:</b> Marks lights as static and uses light
      baking to reduce runtime costs.\n\n<b>\u2022 Our Modification: </b>Ensures
      optimal GPU usage and smooth lighting without frame-by-frame recalculation."
